--- a/RetreatUI/CHANGELOG.txt
+++ b/RetreatUI/CHANGELOG.txt
@@ -1,3 +1,10 @@
+RetreatUI v1.1.0-beta.8
+- Removed interrupts from the Party Utility rows beside individual party frames.
+- Added a separate central Party Interrupt Tracker for the player and every party member.
+- Added Blood Elf Arcane Torrent as a tracked interrupt with automatic race detection and addon sync.
+- Added native spell tooltips, live cooldown/Ready states and a clear no-interrupt-detected state.
+- Added a movable and scalable PARTY INTERRUPTS anchor to the HUD Editor.
+
 RetreatUI v1.1.0-beta.7
 - Party Utility icons now display the native ability tooltip when hovered instead of internal labels such as Group Defensive.
 - Added live cooldown remaining or Ready status beneath the spell tooltip.
